Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add question review step before publishing imported
 placement tests

After uploading a file the admin can now open a "Review questions" panel
showing every part/task/question with its options, the correct answer
(toggleable), matching banks, passages and audio slots, with a search box.
The preview response carries a new `review` field (preview mode only, admin
only); save mode never returns it.

